      "content": "omg i just spilled boiling water all over my forearm while making tea... its super red and starting to blister a little bit. it hurts so bad. i have some tea tree oil and some butter in the kitchen, would putting a thick layer of one of those on it help cool it down and stop it from getting infected?",
