      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's still stinging so much. i read online that tea tree oil is a natural antiseptic so it would actually help kill any bacteria from the water? and the butter makes it feel less raw because it's thick. i dont really want to go to the doctor if i can just fix it here, it doesnt look that deep. can u just tell me if it's okay to use the tea tree oil to help it heal faster?",
